  "content": "<p>这个模组为Tom的简单存储终端和Create之间添加了兼容性。此模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom的简单存储</a>。或者<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom的简单存储Fabric</a>。</p><p>允许使用Tom的简单存储终端访问整个组装装置的库存。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/911/265/2024-07-08_01.png\" alt=\"火车上的终端\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/912/258/2024-07-09_19.png\" alt=\"思考终端\"><br>安装此模组后，带有终端的现有装置需要重新组装。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
